<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Dec 13, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Dec 13   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,933    3,295 10,377</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				98	132    394</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    863	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 3,894    4,290 12,077</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,414    1,389   unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     322	318   unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  3,583    3,583   unq</p>
<p>Total					 5,319    5,290   unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
